msgstr "Vul die bediener, jou naam en jou wagwoord in."

msgid "Given"
msgstr "Gegee"

msgid "Given to"
msgstr "Gegee aan"

msgid "Group %s"
msgstr "Groep %s"

msgid "Group name"
msgstr "Groepnaam"

msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Groepe"

msgid "Hand in"
msgstr "Handig in"

msgid "Hand in? You cannot change your answers afterwards."
msgstr "Handig in? Jy kan jou antwoorde daarna nie meer verander nie."

msgid "Handed in"
msgstr "Ingehandig"

msgid "Handed in. Your teacher will check your answers."
msgstr "Ingehandig. Jou onderwyser sal jou antwoorde nagaan."

msgid "Is this the test server's certificate? Compare its fingerprint with the one the server shows (ask your teacher):\n\n%s\n\n%s"
msgstr "Is dit die toetsbediener se sertifikaat? Vergelyk sy vingerafdruk met die een wat die bediener wys (vra jou onderwyser):\n\n%s\n\n%s"

msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Meld aan"

msgid "Log in to a test server"
msgstr "Meld aan by ’n toetsbediener"

msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Meld af"

msgid "New group"
msgstr "Nuwe groep"

msgid "New test"
msgstr "Nuwe toets"

msgid "New test of a lesson file…"
msgstr "Nuwe toets uit ’n leslêer…"

msgid "New test of the open lesson"
msgstr "Nuwe toets uit die oop les"

msgid "New test server"
msgstr "Nuwe toetsbediener"

msgid "No one has handed in yet."
msgstr "Niemand het nog ingehandig nie."

msgid "No one yet."
msgstr "Nog niemand nie."

msgid "No tests for you yet."
msgstr "Nog geen toetse vir jou nie."

msgid "No tests yet."
msgstr "Nog geen toetse nie."

msgid "Not added: %s"
msgstr "Nie bygevoeg nie: %s"

msgid "Not connected: the certificate was not confirmed."
msgstr "Nie gekoppel nie: die sertifikaat is nie bevestig nie."

msgid "Not handed in yet: %s"
msgstr "Nog nie ingehandig nie: %s"

msgid "One account per line: name, password and (if not a student) the role, separated by commas."
msgstr "Een rekening per reël: naam, wagwoord en (as dit nie ’n leerder is nie) die rol, met kommas geskei."

msgid "Open a word lesson in Recuerdo first."
msgstr "Open eers ’n woordles in Recuerdo."

msgid "Open for handing in"
msgstr "Open vir inhandiging"

msgid "Open the test"
msgstr "Open die toets"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Wagwoord"

msgid "Publish all results"
msgstr "Publiseer alle resultate"

msgid "Publish this result"
msgstr "Publiseer hierdie resultaat"

msgid "Published"
msgstr "Gepubliseer"

msgid "Published: the students can see their results."
msgstr "Gepubliseer: die leerders kan hul resultate sien."

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Verfris"

msgid "Remove %s"
msgstr "Verwyder %s"

msgid "Result ready"
msgstr "Resultaat gereed"

msgid "Right (your teacher's decision)"
msgstr "Reg (jou onderwyser se besluit)"

msgid "Right answers"
msgstr "Regte antwoorde"

msgid "Role"
msgstr "Rol"

msgid "Role…"
msgstr "Rol…"

msgid "Score"
msgstr "Telling"

msgid "See the result"
msgstr "Bekyk die resultaat"

msgid "Server"
msgstr "Bediener"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "Student"
msgstr "Leerder"

msgid "Take tests from a test server, or give them as a teacher"
msgstr "Skryf toetse van ’n toetsbediener, of gee hulle as onderwyser"

msgid "Take the test"
msgstr "Skryf die toets"

msgid "Take the tests your teacher gave you."
msgstr "Skryf die toetse wat jou onderwyser vir jou gegee het."

msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "Onderwyser"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "Toets"

msgid "Test made: %s. Now give it to students or groups."
msgstr "Toets gemaak: %s. Gee dit nou aan leerders of groepe."

msgid "Test mode"
msgstr "Toetsmodus"

msgid "The test gets the lesson's words; students see the questions, never the answers."
msgstr "Die toets kry die les se woorde; leerders sien die vrae, nooit die antwoorde nie."

msgid "To do"
msgstr "Nog te doen"

msgid "Wrong name or password."
msgstr "Verkeerde naam of wagwoord."

msgid "Yes, delete %s"
msgstr "Ja, skrap %s"

msgid "Yes, delete it with its results"
msgstr "Ja, skrap dit met sy resultate"

msgid "Yes, hand in"
msgstr "Ja, handig in"

msgid "Your teacher tells you the server's address. Students can also take tests in a web browser, at the same address."
msgstr "Jou onderwyser sê vir jou wat die bediener se adres is. Leerders kan ook toetse in ’n webblaaier skryf, by dieselfde adres."

msgid "Your tests"
msgstr "Jou toetse"
